# See https://help.github.com/articles/ignoring-files/ for more about ignoring files.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Dependencies
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
/node_modules
/.pnp
.pnp.*
.yarn/*
!.yarn/patches
!.yarn/plugins
!.yarn/releases
!.yarn/versions

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Build output
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
/.next/
/out/
/build
/dist
.turbo
*.tsbuildinfo
# Regenerated by `next dev`/`next build`; committing it causes needless churn.
next-env.d.ts

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Secrets
#
# `.env*` is a deliberate catch-all: it covers .env, .env.local,
# .env.production and anything else a fork invents. Only the documented
# template is allowed through, and it must never hold a real value.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.env*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
*.p12

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Test and tooling output
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
/coverage
/test-results
/playwright-report
/blob-report
/playwright/.cache
/storybook-static
# Signed-in browser sessions saved by the e2e setup project — real cookies.
/.playwright

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# graphify — generated architecture graph
#
# Ignored wholesale for two reasons: the dotfiles inside record absolute paths
# from the machine that built them, and graph.json/graph.html are ~3 MB of
# derived output that goes stale on the first edit a fork makes.
#
# To ship the architecture map as a product feature, un-ignore just the clean
# artifacts (they contain no absolute paths) and leave the rest ignored:
#     !graphify-out/GRAPH_REPORT.md
#     !graphify-out/graph.json
#     !graphify-out/graph.html
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
/graphify-out

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Editors and OS
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.idea/
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
!.vscode/settings.json.example
*.swp
*~

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Logs and local scratch
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
.pnpm-debug.log*
*.local

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Deploy platforms
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.vercel
